// - Production migration must validate Reporting metrics/insights/provenance payload contracts and atomic latest-publication consistency transactionally/runtime-side.
// - Production migration must validate Share execution timing, Campaign shareability, request replay safety, opaque tracking-token generation and Application SHARE attribution runtime-side.
